# Required Changes & Fixes

## Priority 1 — Bugs

### 1. Create-user invite link closes instantly
- **Location:** Admin Panel → Create User
- **Bug:** Clicking "Create user" shows the invite-link overlay for a few milliseconds then auto-closes.
- **Expected:** Overlay stays open until the admin explicitly closes it (close button or clicking outside).

### 2. Password recovery page not scrollable
- **Location:** Password Recovery page
- **Bug:** When form elements extend beyond the viewport, the page cannot be scrolled.
- **Expected:** Page is scrollable via mouse wheel (desktop) and touch-drag (mobile).

## Priority 2 — UX Improvements

### 3. Password recovery: replace "Reset Password" with "Proceed to Login" after success
- **Location:** Password Recovery page (post-reset state)
- **Change:** After a successful password reset and new recovery key display:
  - Hide the "Reset Password" button.
  - Show a "Proceed to Login" button that navigates back to the login page.

## Priority 3 — UI Overhaul (Overlay-First Navigation)

> **Design principle:** Replace sliding side panels with overlay menus/windows for a cleaner, mobile-friendly experience across all device sizes.

### 4. Header bar redesign
- **Change:** Simplify the default header. Left-to-right layout:
  1. Hamburger menu button (opens the main navigation overlay — see item 5)
  2. Workspace Name — [Board Name]
     - If the user has access to multiple workspaces, the workspace name becomes a dropdown to switch between them.
     - The board name is also a dropdown, listing only the boards within the currently selected workspace.
  3. View options (Board, Table, Calendar)
  4. Filter
  5. Search
  6. Notifications
  7. Admin (visible only to sys-admin role)
  8. Profile avatar/initials button (opens profile overlay — see item 7)

### 5. Main navigation overlay (replaces left sidebar)
- **Trigger:** Hamburger menu button (top-left)
- **Content:** Tabbed overlay with four tabs:
  - Workspaces
  - Boards
  - Automations
  - Archive

### 6. Admin panel overlay (replaces right sidebar)
- **Trigger:** Admin button in header
- **Change:** Open as an overlay menu instead of a sliding right-side panel.

### 7. Profile menu overlay (replaces dropdown)
- **Trigger:** Profile initials button (top-right)
- **Change:** Open as an overlay menu instead of a dropdown menu.